@Telematics_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002
@PolicyNumber = POL-REPLACEME

### Record a trip (use a policy number returned by the Policy service)
POST {{Telematics_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "{{PolicyNumber}}",
  "startTimeUtc": "2026-11-03T08:00:00Z",
  "endTimeUtc": "2026-11-03T08:45:00Z",
  "milesDriven": 25.5,
  "hardBrakeCount": 1,
  "rapidAccelerationCount": 0,
  "maxSpeedMph": 72
}

### List a policy's trips
GET {{Telematics_HostAddress}}/api/trips/policy/{{PolicyNumber}}
